WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:08.625
Give guests a reason to stop, step in, and
spend time with your brand.

00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:14.458
VNV Events produces hospitality lounges,
product sampling, and photo experiences

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:19.417
designed around how you want guests to take
part.

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:25.792
We develop the concept with you and plan
the layout, staffing, and setup around the

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.000
venue and event.

00:00:27.292 --> 00:00:32.667
Our team coordinates installation and
event-day delivery, with the brand and

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:35.125
organizer’s approvals agreed in advance.

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:41.625
Tell us who you want to reach and how you
want them to participate. Let’s design that

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.000
moment.
